# szal_mcp_tools_net.tcyr — network MCP tools (mcp_tools_net.cyr): szal_http, szal_dns_lookup,
# szal_port_check, szal_url_encode + the szal_all_tools()/szal_register_tools() aggregator.
#
# Ports rust-old/src/mcp/tools/net_tools.rs tests (SSRF rejections, dns localhost/invalid, port check,
# url encode/decode/roundtrip/utf8) + the full 54-tool registration.
#
#   cyrius build --strict --no-deps tests/szal_mcp_tools_net.tcyr build/test_mcp_tools_net
#   ./build/test_mcp_tools_net

